    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To be more specific for the investors, should they be looking at this through the lens of \"tribalism\"? Specifically, in these kinds of West African contexts, is it more likely that the conflict will be driven by ideological political parties or more by these deep-seated ethnic/tribal identities? I'm trying to gauge if the instability is structural or just inherently tied to the ethnic makeup of the groups involved.",
